              <span>{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'home' %}<b>Everyday use</b><small>How the kit fits into a regular home-puja routine.</small></span>
              <span>{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'gift' %}<b>Gifting</b><small>Whether the presentation felt suitable for family or loved ones.</small></span>
